# Patch-ID: P-TAB-001 / P-NAV-001 (wave 12, script results)
# Area: tab.
# Rationale: trusted boost editor/element picker need asynchronous JSON-valued
#   evaluation in per-boost isolated worlds or explicit primary main world,
#   with bounded deadlines and cancellation rather than stale document results.
# Last-Rebased: 2026-11-02 (Chromium 156.0.8078.74).
# Frozen-file exceptions: extend existing ABI/services and export lists only;
#   no public structure size changes, page bridge, user activation or browser
#   target. data documents are eligible for restricted page evaluation.
# Validation: build-p31 (attempt 2); smoke-tab020 G1-G5; native eval/core/
#   services/URLs; nm-tab020 (39 exports via framework).

